    "description": "Classifies netdoctor, a read-only network health-check CLI. One-shot checks (DNS lookup, one ICMP ping, a TCP connect, an HTTP GET, and a traceroute) are low-risk outbound probes and stay inert. Live --watch and --mtr monitors re-probe on an interval until interrupted and are reviewed.",
